  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "三千年前的利簋，把武王伐纣钉在时间轴上；四羊方尊把青铜铸造推到极限；《清明上河图》装下一座汴京城；后母戊鼎扛过战争；太阳神鸟金饰飞上太空#中国国宝 #国宝档案 #博物馆 #文物 #历史冷知识 #涨知识",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_09b6883498b9cb68_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 500.205011,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们盘了。第十到第六，流经五马鲜杯。文银壶封存了盛世的记忆。金缕玉衣封存了一个人的身体，镶金兽首玛瑙杯放出了石头里的兽，越王勾践剑打开了两千年的时光，曾侯乙编钟改写了世界音乐史。好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了。有人说后母戊鼎呢？有人说四羊方尊呢别急，今天这集就是第五到第一一件，比一件震撼，最后那个是中国文化遗产的标志。老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听。第五名立这件青铜器藏在国家博物馆一九七六年出土于陕西，临潼高二十八厘米。袁父方座双耳看起来不起眼，可他肚子里刻着四行三十二个字的铭文。这三十三个字记录了一件事。武王伐纣铭文上写着，武王在甲子日清晨碎星正当空的时候，发动了对商纣王的进攻，一天之内就取得了胜利。这三十三个字让中国历史上最著名的一场战争有了确切的日期。公元前一四六年一月二十日，考古学家管他叫西周第一青铜器，一件青铜器，把三千年前改朝换代的那一天定在了时间轴上。第四名四羊方尊这件宝贝藏在国家博物馆一九三八年，出土于湖南宁乡，高五十八点六厘米，重三十四点五公斤。它的造型是四只羊背对背羊角卷曲扬身，连着气身，四只羊共同托起一个方针，羊的脚、耳朵、鼻子眼睛全都刻的清清楚楚。铸造这么一件东西，用的是分柱法，先把羊角和龙头单独住好，再嵌进外饭里浇筑器身让它们长在一起。商代的工匠没有精密仪器，全靠手感和经验，一键四羊方尊把青铜铸造的极限推到了天花板。他出土的时候，是被当地农民当成乌金挖出来的，后来在战乱中被炸成二十多块碎片，一九五二年才被修复。现在，他站在国家博物馆的展柜里，四只羊安安静静的看着每一个走过去的人。第三名清明上河图这幅画藏在故宫博物院卷本长五百二十八厘米，高二十四点八厘米。北宋画家张择端画的是汴景，也就是今天的开封。从城外到城内的景象，画上有八百多个人物八十多头，牲畜三十多栋房屋、二十多艘船二十多辆车轿。每个人都有自己的动作，有挑担的，有推车的，有乘船的，有在桥上朝驾的，有在酒楼里吃饭的张择端画。这幅画的时候，北宋还没亡，他大概不知道他画的。这座城几十年后，就会被金兵攻破，皇帝被掳走，百姓流离失所。这幅画是汴京留给后世的一座纸上都城。故宫的专家说。这幅画是域之广为早期绘画之最，一张画装下了一做成。讲了这么多评论区，好多朋友说这些国宝看着是真震撼，可咱们这年纪去不了那么多博物馆，腿脚也不好带孙子的时候，想讲讲这些宝贝背后的故事，自己也说不全。前阵子我翻到一本叫中华文化常识一千问的书，分门别类，一问一答，把中国历史上的文化常识讲的清清楚楚。这些国宝的来龙去脉，书里都有，特别适合中老年朋友，每天翻两页，心里全有谱。已经放下面了，点开就能看到，喜欢历史的弄一本放床头，随手翻一页就是一段历史。第二名，后母屋顶，这座顶藏在国家博物馆。一九三九年出土于河南安阳阴墟，高一百三十三厘米，重八百三十二点八四公斤。他是全世界出土最大最重的青铜器，铸造这么一座顶。需要先做模型，再翻饭，再合饭再浇筑。光融化铜水就需要几十座熔炉。同时开工，浇筑的时候，桶水必须连续不断的灌进去，中间一断，整个鼎就废了。商代的工匠是怎么组织几百人同时作业的？到现在还是个谜，更觉得是他出土的时候，正值抗日战争，日本人听说了开出高价要买，村民，怕他被抢走，又把它埋回了地下，直到抗战胜利才重新挖出来。一座鼎扛过了三千年的岁月，也扛过了一场战争。第一名。太阳神鸟金士这件宝贝藏在成都金沙遗址博物馆，它有多小？外径？十二点五厘米，厚度只有零点零二二厘米，比一张纸厚不了多少，含金量百分之九十四点二。整件金饰的图案分内外两层，外层是四肢首尾向前的飞鸟，展翅盘旋。内层是十二道弧形光芒，向太阳放射出的光。四只鸟可能代表四个季节或者四个方向，十二道光芒，可能代表十二个月份或者十二个时辰。三千年前的古蜀人，用一块金子把他们对天对地、对时间对生命的理解，全部浓缩在了一个巴掌大的圆里。二五年，他被选为中国文化遗产标志，神舟六号飞船带着他的复制品飞上了太空。三千年前古蜀人仰望的那只太阳神鸟，真的飞起来了。这块小小的金箔，是古蜀人留给所有中国人的一封。三千年前的信信上说，我们崇拜太阳，我们向往光明。我们相信我们的后代有一天会飞到天上，他们做到了。您发现没有？这十件镇国之宝，没有一件是单纯靠才智值钱的刘金午马贤碑文银壶记着盛世的记忆，金缕玉衣封存着一个人的身体，镶金兽首玛瑙杯，放出了石头里的兽。越王勾践剑连接着两千年的时光，曾侯乙编钟改写的音乐史立肯盯住了改朝换代的那一天。四羊方尊把青铜铸造推到了极限清明上河图，装下了一座城后母屋顶，扛过了一场战争。太阳神鸟金氏把三千年前的信仰送上了太空，每一件宝贝的厉害之处都不在它有多重，在它里面锁着一段中国人不能忘记的记忆，点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00001",
      "start_ms": 210,
      "end_ms": 710,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00002",
      "start_ms": 990,
      "end_ms": 1750,
      "text": "咱们盘了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00003",
      "start_ms": 1750,
      "end_ms": 3330,
      "text": "第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4510,
      "end_ms": 5910,
      "text": "流经五马鲜杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6010,
      "end_ms": 8670,
      "text": "文银壶封存了盛世的记忆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9110,
      "end_ms": 12190,
      "text": "金缕玉衣封存了一个人的身体，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13210,
      "end_ms": 16470,
      "text": "镶金兽首玛瑙杯放出了石头里的兽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00008",
      "start_ms": 16950,
      "end_ms": 20330,
      "text": "越王勾践剑打开了两千年的时光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00009",
      "start_ms": 21010,
      "end_ms": 24030,
      "text": "曾侯乙编钟改写了世界音乐史。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00010",
      "start_ms": 24550,
      "end_ms": 27150,
      "text": "好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00011",
      "start_ms": 27430,
      "end_ms": 29570,
      "text": "有人说后母戊鼎呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00012",
      "start_ms": 30410,
      "end_ms": 33230,
      "text": "有人说四羊方尊呢别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00013",
      "start_ms": 33710,
      "end_ms": 37790,
      "text": "今天这集就是第五到第一一件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00014",
      "start_ms": 37850,
      "end_ms": 39110,
      "text": "比一件震撼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00015",
      "start_ms": 39330,
      "end_ms": 42510,
      "text": "最后那个是中国文化遗产的标志。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00016",
      "start_ms": 43010,
      "end_ms": 47170,
      "text": "老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00017",
      "start_ms": 47530,
      "end_ms": 49510,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00018",
      "start_ms": 50490,
      "end_ms": 57890,
      "text": "第五名立这件青铜器藏在国家博物馆一九七六年出土于陕西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00019",
      "start_ms": 57910,
      "end_ms": 60075,
      "text": "临潼高二十八厘米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00020",
      "start_ms": 60470,
      "end_ms": 63885,
      "text": "袁父方座双耳看起来不起眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00021",
      "start_ms": 64210,
      "end_ms": 67605,
      "text": "可他肚子里刻着四行三十二个字的铭文。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00022",
      "start_ms": 68260,
      "end_ms": 71565,
      "text": "这三十三个字记录了一件事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00023",
      "start_ms": 71900,
      "end_ms": 74655,
      "text": "武王伐纣铭文上写着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00024",
      "start_ms": 74970,
      "end_ms": 79325,
      "text": "武王在甲子日清晨碎星正当空的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00025",
      "start_ms": 79720,
      "end_ms": 81565,
      "text": "发动了对商纣王的进攻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00026",
      "start_ms": 82150,
      "end_ms": 83895,
      "text": "一天之内就取得了胜利。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00027",
      "start_ms": 84760,
      "end_ms": 91325,
      "text": "这三十三个字让中国历史上最著名的一场战争有了确切的日期。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00028",
      "start_ms": 92110,
      "end_ms": 94475,
      "text": "公元前一四六年一月二十日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00029",
      "start_ms": 94830,
      "end_ms": 97725,
      "text": "考古学家管他叫西周第一青铜器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00030",
      "start_ms": 98620,
      "end_ms": 99715,
      "text": "一件青铜器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00031",
      "start_ms": 99980,
      "end_ms": 104885,
      "text": "把三千年前改朝换代的那一天定在了时间轴上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00032",
      "start_ms": 105160,
      "end_ms": 112150,
      "text": "第四名四羊方尊这件宝贝藏在国家博物馆一九三八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00033",
      "start_ms": 112170,
      "end_ms": 114145,
      "text": "出土于湖南宁乡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00034",
      "start_ms": 114410,
      "end_ms": 116115,
      "text": "高五十八点六厘米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00035",
      "start_ms": 116380,
      "end_ms": 118455,
      "text": "重三十四点五公斤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00036",
      "start_ms": 119080,
      "end_ms": 124580,
      "text": "它的造型是四只羊背对背羊角卷曲扬身，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00037",
      "start_ms": 124620,
      "end_ms": 125465,
      "text": "连着气身，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00038",
      "start_ms": 125890,
      "end_ms": 128365,
      "text": "四只羊共同托起一个方针，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00039",
      "start_ms": 128820,
      "end_ms": 134505,
      "text": "羊的脚、耳朵、鼻子眼睛全都刻的清清楚楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00040",
      "start_ms": 134870,
      "end_ms": 136135,
      "text": "铸造这么一件东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00041",
      "start_ms": 136380,
      "end_ms": 137645,
      "text": "用的是分柱法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00042",
      "start_ms": 138110,
      "end_ms": 140770,
      "text": "先把羊角和龙头单独住好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00043",
      "start_ms": 141010,
      "end_ms": 145375,
      "text": "再嵌进外饭里浇筑器身让它们长在一起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00044",
      "start_ms": 146380,
      "end_ms": 148825,
      "text": "商代的工匠没有精密仪器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00045",
      "start_ms": 149170,
      "end_ms": 150685,
      "text": "全靠手感和经验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00046",
      "start_ms": 151250,
      "end_ms": 157395,
      "text": "一键四羊方尊把青铜铸造的极限推到了天花板。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00047",
      "start_ms": 158210,
      "end_ms": 159365,
      "text": "他出土的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00048",
      "start_ms": 159840,
      "end_ms": 162765,
      "text": "是被当地农民当成乌金挖出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00049",
      "start_ms": 163580,
      "end_ms": 166965,
      "text": "后来在战乱中被炸成二十多块碎片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00050",
      "start_ms": 167590,
      "end_ms": 169235,
      "text": "一九五二年才被修复。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00051",
      "start_ms": 169840,
      "end_ms": 170260,
      "text": "现在，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00052",
      "start_ms": 170400,
      "end_ms": 172415,
      "text": "他站在国家博物馆的展柜里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00053",
      "start_ms": 172760,
      "end_ms": 176495,
      "text": "四只羊安安静静的看着每一个走过去的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00054",
      "start_ms": 177650,
      "end_ms": 185400,
      "text": "第三名清明上河图这幅画藏在故宫博物院卷本长五百二十八厘米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00055",
      "start_ms": 185540,
      "end_ms": 187200,
      "text": "高二十四点八厘米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00056",
      "start_ms": 187560,
      "end_ms": 190360,
      "text": "北宋画家张择端画的是汴景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00057",
      "start_ms": 190440,
      "end_ms": 191800,
      "text": "也就是今天的开封。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00058",
      "start_ms": 192280,
      "end_ms": 194680,
      "text": "从城外到城内的景象，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00059",
      "start_ms": 195220,
      "end_ms": 198440,
      "text": "画上有八百多个人物八十多头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00060",
      "start_ms": 198440,
      "end_ms": 203100,
      "text": "牲畜三十多栋房屋、二十多艘船二十多辆车轿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00061",
      "start_ms": 203660,
      "end_ms": 205380,
      "text": "每个人都有自己的动作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00062",
      "start_ms": 205740,
      "end_ms": 206760,
      "text": "有挑担的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00063",
      "start_ms": 206840,
      "end_ms": 207840,
      "text": "有推车的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00064",
      "start_ms": 207900,
      "end_ms": 208920,
      "text": "有乘船的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00065",
      "start_ms": 209080,
      "end_ms": 210550,
      "text": "有在桥上朝驾的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00066",
      "start_ms": 210650,
      "end_ms": 213930,
      "text": "有在酒楼里吃饭的张择端画。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00067",
      "start_ms": 213930,
      "end_ms": 215110,
      "text": "这幅画的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00068",
      "start_ms": 215450,
      "end_ms": 216550,
      "text": "北宋还没亡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00069",
      "start_ms": 216790,
      "end_ms": 218830,
      "text": "他大概不知道他画的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00070",
      "start_ms": 218830,
      "end_ms": 220570,
      "text": "这座城几十年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00071",
      "start_ms": 220810,
      "end_ms": 222430,
      "text": "就会被金兵攻破，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00072",
      "start_ms": 222870,
      "end_ms": 223990,
      "text": "皇帝被掳走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00073",
      "start_ms": 224350,
      "end_ms": 226090,
      "text": "百姓流离失所。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00074",
      "start_ms": 226250,
      "end_ms": 230710,
      "text": "这幅画是汴京留给后世的一座纸上都城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00075",
      "start_ms": 231750,
      "end_ms": 232870,
      "text": "故宫的专家说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00076",
      "start_ms": 233330,
      "end_ms": 237430,
      "text": "这幅画是域之广为早期绘画之最，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00077",
      "start_ms": 238170,
      "end_ms": 240615,
      "text": "一张画装下了一做成。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00078",
      "start_ms": 241240,
      "end_ms": 243050,
      "text": "讲了这么多评论区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00079",
      "start_ms": 243050,
      "end_ms": 246505,
      "text": "好多朋友说这些国宝看着是真震撼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00080",
      "start_ms": 246960,
      "end_ms": 249665,
      "text": "可咱们这年纪去不了那么多博物馆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00081",
      "start_ms": 250050,
      "end_ms": 252500,
      "text": "腿脚也不好带孙子的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00082",
      "start_ms": 252680,
      "end_ms": 254885,
      "text": "想讲讲这些宝贝背后的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00083",
      "start_ms": 255520,
      "end_ms": 256545,
      "text": "自己也说不全。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00084",
      "start_ms": 257800,
      "end_ms": 262440,
      "text": "前阵子我翻到一本叫中华文化常识一千问的书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00085",
      "start_ms": 262620,
      "end_ms": 263545,
      "text": "分门别类，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00086",
      "start_ms": 263910,
      "end_ms": 264775,
      "text": "一问一答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00087",
      "start_ms": 265050,
      "end_ms": 268715,
      "text": "把中国历史上的文化常识讲的清清楚楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00088",
      "start_ms": 269470,
      "end_ms": 271285,
      "text": "这些国宝的来龙去脉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00089",
      "start_ms": 271600,
      "end_ms": 272415,
      "text": "书里都有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00090",
      "start_ms": 273040,
      "end_ms": 275065,
      "text": "特别适合中老年朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00091",
      "start_ms": 275480,
      "end_ms": 276375,
      "text": "每天翻两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00092",
      "start_ms": 276800,
      "end_ms": 277785,
      "text": "心里全有谱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00093",
      "start_ms": 278460,
      "end_ms": 279585,
      "text": "已经放下面了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00094",
      "start_ms": 279910,
      "end_ms": 281115,
      "text": "点开就能看到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00095",
      "start_ms": 281450,
      "end_ms": 283435,
      "text": "喜欢历史的弄一本放床头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00096",
      "start_ms": 283890,
      "end_ms": 285885,
      "text": "随手翻一页就是一段历史。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00097",
      "start_ms": 286220,
      "end_ms": 286915,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00098",
      "start_ms": 287410,
      "end_ms": 288255,
      "text": "后母屋顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00099",
      "start_ms": 288730,
      "end_ms": 291265,
      "text": "这座顶藏在国家博物馆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00100",
      "start_ms": 291750,
      "end_ms": 295405,
      "text": "一九三九年出土于河南安阳阴墟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00101",
      "start_ms": 295830,
      "end_ms": 297525,
      "text": "高一百三十三厘米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00102",
      "start_ms": 297620,
      "end_ms": 300275,
      "text": "重八百三十二点八四公斤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00103",
      "start_ms": 300720,
      "end_ms": 304465,
      "text": "他是全世界出土最大最重的青铜器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00104",
      "start_ms": 305200,
      "end_ms": 306595,
      "text": "铸造这么一座顶。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00105",
      "start_ms": 307190,
      "end_ms": 308550,
      "text": "需要先做模型，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00106",
      "start_ms": 308950,
      "end_ms": 309690,
      "text": "再翻饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00107",
      "start_ms": 309870,
      "end_ms": 311550,
      "text": "再合饭再浇筑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00108",
      "start_ms": 312030,
      "end_ms": 315730,
      "text": "光融化铜水就需要几十座熔炉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00109",
      "start_ms": 316010,
      "end_ms": 317110,
      "text": "同时开工，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00110",
      "start_ms": 317950,
      "end_ms": 319030,
      "text": "浇筑的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00111",
      "start_ms": 319310,
      "end_ms": 322670,
      "text": "桶水必须连续不断的灌进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00112",
      "start_ms": 323390,
      "end_ms": 324350,
      "text": "中间一断，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00113",
      "start_ms": 324550,
      "end_ms": 325850,
      "text": "整个鼎就废了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00114",
      "start_ms": 326070,
      "end_ms": 330810,
      "text": "商代的工匠是怎么组织几百人同时作业的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00115",
      "start_ms": 331490,
      "end_ms": 333450,
      "text": "到现在还是个谜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00116",
      "start_ms": 334410,
      "end_ms": 336805,
      "text": "更觉得是他出土的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00117",
      "start_ms": 338080,
      "end_ms": 339460,
      "text": "正值抗日战争，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00118",
      "start_ms": 339600,
      "end_ms": 342160,
      "text": "日本人听说了开出高价要买，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00119",
      "start_ms": 342380,
      "end_ms": 342820,
      "text": "村民，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00120",
      "start_ms": 342860,
      "end_ms": 343840,
      "text": "怕他被抢走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00121",
      "start_ms": 344020,
      "end_ms": 345440,
      "text": "又把它埋回了地下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00122",
      "start_ms": 345680,
      "end_ms": 348500,
      "text": "直到抗战胜利才重新挖出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00123",
      "start_ms": 349280,
      "end_ms": 352320,
      "text": "一座鼎扛过了三千年的岁月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00124",
      "start_ms": 352700,
      "end_ms": 354240,
      "text": "也扛过了一场战争。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00125",
      "start_ms": 355580,
      "end_ms": 356160,
      "text": "第一名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00126",
      "start_ms": 356360,
      "end_ms": 361600,
      "text": "太阳神鸟金士这件宝贝藏在成都金沙遗址博物馆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00127",
      "start_ms": 362000,
      "end_ms": 362860,
      "text": "它有多小？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00128",
      "start_ms": 363860,
      "end_ms": 364420,
      "text": "外径？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00129",
      "start_ms": 364500,
      "end_ms": 365680,
      "text": "十二点五厘米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00130",
      "start_ms": 365940,
      "end_ms": 368325,
      "text": "厚度只有零点零二二厘米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00131",
      "start_ms": 368920,
      "end_ms": 370995,
      "text": "比一张纸厚不了多少，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00132",
      "start_ms": 371440,
      "end_ms": 373885,
      "text": "含金量百分之九十四点二。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00133",
      "start_ms": 374540,
      "end_ms": 377755,
      "text": "整件金饰的图案分内外两层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00134",
      "start_ms": 378130,
      "end_ms": 381195,
      "text": "外层是四肢首尾向前的飞鸟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00135",
      "start_ms": 381720,
      "end_ms": 382825,
      "text": "展翅盘旋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00136",
      "start_ms": 383290,
      "end_ms": 386165,
      "text": "内层是十二道弧形光芒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00137",
      "start_ms": 386640,
      "end_ms": 388375,
      "text": "向太阳放射出的光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00138",
      "start_ms": 388780,
      "end_ms": 392675,
      "text": "四只鸟可能代表四个季节或者四个方向，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00139",
      "start_ms": 393170,
      "end_ms": 394185,
      "text": "十二道光芒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00140",
      "start_ms": 394500,
      "end_ms": 397395,
      "text": "可能代表十二个月份或者十二个时辰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00141",
      "start_ms": 398310,
      "end_ms": 400010,
      "text": "三千年前的古蜀人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00142",
      "start_ms": 400290,
      "end_ms": 405335,
      "text": "用一块金子把他们对天对地、对时间对生命的理解，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00143",
      "start_ms": 405760,
      "end_ms": 408605,
      "text": "全部浓缩在了一个巴掌大的圆里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00144",
      "start_ms": 409540,
      "end_ms": 410245,
      "text": "二五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00145",
      "start_ms": 410530,
      "end_ms": 413760,
      "text": "他被选为中国文化遗产标志，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00146",
      "start_ms": 413980,
      "end_ms": 417645,
      "text": "神舟六号飞船带着他的复制品飞上了太空。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00147",
      "start_ms": 418390,
      "end_ms": 422115,
      "text": "三千年前古蜀人仰望的那只太阳神鸟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00148",
      "start_ms": 422450,
      "end_ms": 423405,
      "text": "真的飞起来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00149",
      "start_ms": 423940,
      "end_ms": 425555,
      "text": "这块小小的金箔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00150",
      "start_ms": 425950,
      "end_ms": 428435,
      "text": "是古蜀人留给所有中国人的一封。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00151",
      "start_ms": 428820,
      "end_ms": 431695,
      "text": "三千年前的信信上说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00152",
      "start_ms": 432390,
      "end_ms": 433575,
      "text": "我们崇拜太阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00153",
      "start_ms": 433810,
      "end_ms": 434835,
      "text": "我们向往光明。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00154",
      "start_ms": 435320,
      "end_ms": 439595,
      "text": "我们相信我们的后代有一天会飞到天上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00155",
      "start_ms": 440370,
      "end_ms": 441345,
      "text": "他们做到了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00156",
      "start_ms": 441550,
      "end_ms": 442425,
      "text": "您发现没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00157",
      "start_ms": 443460,
      "end_ms": 445535,
      "text": "这十件镇国之宝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00158",
      "start_ms": 445920,
      "end_ms": 454080,
      "text": "没有一件是单纯靠才智值钱的刘金午马贤碑文银壶记着盛世的记忆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00159",
      "start_ms": 454260,
      "end_ms": 457285,
      "text": "金缕玉衣封存着一个人的身体，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00160",
      "start_ms": 457840,
      "end_ms": 459300,
      "text": "镶金兽首玛瑙杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00161",
      "start_ms": 459520,
      "end_ms": 460965,
      "text": "放出了石头里的兽。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00162",
      "start_ms": 461730,
      "end_ms": 464335,
      "text": "越王勾践剑连接着两千年的时光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00163",
      "start_ms": 464640,
      "end_ms": 470435,
      "text": "曾侯乙编钟改写的音乐史立肯盯住了改朝换代的那一天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00164",
      "start_ms": 471400,
      "end_ms": 477230,
      "text": "四羊方尊把青铜铸造推到了极限清明上河图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00165",
      "start_ms": 477550,
      "end_ms": 480485,
      "text": "装下了一座城后母屋顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00166",
      "start_ms": 480860,
      "end_ms": 482255,
      "text": "扛过了一场战争。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00167",
      "start_ms": 482850,
      "end_ms": 488080,
      "text": "太阳神鸟金氏把三千年前的信仰送上了太空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00168",
      "start_ms": 488760,
      "end_ms": 492560,
      "text": "每一件宝贝的厉害之处都不在它有多重，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00169",
      "start_ms": 492700,
      "end_ms": 496660,
      "text": "在它里面锁着一段中国人不能忘记的记忆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00170",
      "start_ms": 497480,
      "end_ms": 498280,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_09b6883498b9cb68_s00171",
      "start_ms": 498580,
      "end_ms": 500075,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
